-The feature dimension $d$ varies by method (e.g., 512 for CLIP, 768 for LSeg/CLIP text, or compressed latent dimensions) [S1, unofficial]. The rendering pipeline produces a 2D feature map $\mathbf{F} \in \mathbb{R}^{H \times W \times d}$, which is subsequently compared against text embeddings or decoded to produce segmentation masks [S1, unofficial].
