+Augments Gaussians with compact language features distilled from a VLM via a scene-specific autoencoder. Sets it apart by focusing on memory-efficient latent space projection and medical VLM integration. Choose it for high-memory-constrained environments or specialized domain segmentation.
 
 ### CLIP-Based 3D Model Search
-Searches a database of 3D models (3D-FUTURE) to find assets matching segmented objects in an input image using CLIP embeddings [S2]. It encodes all renderings from the 3D-FUTURE database using CLIP into normalized 768-dimensional vectors, crops target images around object masks, and selects nearest neighbors in CLIP space using cosine distance [S2]. The database contains 10,000+ artist-made models [S2].
